{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-fd8223c83eb7c5c17d9e0cbcc9c96a4b829647957ab67fcf","family_id":"KR:012159","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법","kind":"법률","source_version":"284117","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=284117","source_sha256":"c141291f23520264444e31f7c7002ae169ff7b5f49b50f81aade863d8c364da6","body_sha256":"d517d1c586b79f47db202f1ce334d3b0290f34800a8e7046ef16b14d14327fc3","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 32 (Request for Attendance of Witnesses, etc.) (1) Where the Inquest requests for the submission of materials or things or for the attendance of a witness, appraiser, or reference witness in relation to a hearing, the Chairperson of the Inquest shall issue a written request to the relevant person or the head of the relevant agency. \n  (2) Where materials are requested under paragraph (1), the Chairperson may require that they be submitted in writing, in electronic documents, as recorded on computer magnetic tapes or magnetic discs or other similar media, or as entered into a computer network. \n  (3) Each written request referred to in paragraph (1) shall state the date, time, and place on and at which the materials or things shall be submitted or the witness, appraiser, or reference witness shall attend, and matters concerning legal sanctions where the relevant person fails to comply with such request, as well as, in cases of the witness or reference witness, the major issues to be examined. \n  (4) Each written request referred to in paragraph (1) shall be served at least seven days before the date the submission of materials or things shall be made or the witness, appraiser, or reference witness shall attend. \n  (5) With respect to the service of written requests referred to in paragraph (1), the provisions of the Civil Procedure Act concerning service shall apply mutatis mutandis. \n  (6) Any witness or reference witness requested to attend may submit in advance a written answer to the major issues to be examined.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.title.json","sha256":"4c74ab84248a6134281cf6996ae8261b572ae5b9e5754e6ad1e8c39880d0d84f"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-32.json","sha256":"18a9dbc95489f86336ef737093672e4f6bbbb427b0b5eadc5965bdc75b1b12c1"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-32.selfcheck.json","sha256":"f1c633a480fb0b0a1eb46034530e55b337fcc2862f5350b0a9af1e3b834a1ff9"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-32.txt","sha256":"7594438ed08258ae6143de037b522930e3439b9ef89c501f39a1f8e4b8e15cb9"},"unit_key":"article-32"}],"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"PARENT:kr-012159-284117-ko","component_ids":["PARENT:kr-012159-284117-ko:article-32"],"component_kind":"PARENT","edition_id":"edition-aaac9e18dc1283df53dd49fe3d7839553ade3b573357548d","frozen_scope_plan_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\